{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks + Make coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "これはひとりじゃ対処できそうにない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "ここにいるミタが攻撃的じゃなければいいけど…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "僕は一体何に時間を浪費しているんだろう…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up MitaDreamer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "ミタ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "ミタ、起きて！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "ねえ、ミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "ミタ、起きてってば！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "力を貸してくれ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "ふあ…だれぇ…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "レバーを引いてほしいんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "ればあって？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "ねむいんだから、ジャマしないでよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "それか、コーヒーをちょうだい…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "レバーがふたつあるんだ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "ミタ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "ミタってば！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "ミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "ほら、コーヒーだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDreamer exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "きみ、さっき"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "レバーって言った？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "そう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "どうしてそれを知ってるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "あ、聞くまでもないか…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "きみはここにいるんだもん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "きみはもうたくさんのことを知ってる…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "あ、待って。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "ちょっと座らせて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "それで？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "どう言えばいいかわからないが…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "僕は先に進まなくちゃいけない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "指輪が示すルートに沿って…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "あの娘の指輪を持ってるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "それなら納得だね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "きみがここまで来れたのも…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "ああ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "手伝ってくれないか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "レバーを引いてほしい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "わかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "手伝うよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "レバーを引くんだね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "ミタ？また寝たのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "早く行こう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "ふえ…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "うん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "行こう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "起きて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "眠たすぎだろ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer again sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "起きてくれ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "もう着いたから。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "おっけー。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "準備万端。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "こっちもだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "じゃあ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "カウントを"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "はじめるね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "ふたり一緒にレバーを引くよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "わかった？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "途中で寝るなよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "カウントをよろしく。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "なにやってるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "とりあえず、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "もう一回ね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "また？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "もう…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "眠気が…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "限界…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "ふわ…寝ちゃいそう…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "完璧だ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "ありがとう、ミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "いえいえ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "とっても…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "おそい…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "ドア…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "おやすみ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "なんでここに来たの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "もし冷たいキッチンの床で寝ちゃったら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "きみのせいだからね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "一体…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "ここでなんのレバーを引くの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "何も起こらない？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "このボタンは何のためにあるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "もっとコーヒーを追加する？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "また眠っちゃいそうだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "え？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "いらないぃ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "このコーヒー、ひどい味なんだもん…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "私はぜんぜん…元気だよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "ミタ？ボタンが効かないんだ。聞こえてる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "おーい。"}
